WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:05.275
Font Manager chooses the font family for each public text type.

00:00:05.325 --> 00:00:11.020
There are fifteen bundled fonts across twenty roles, including page titles,

00:00:11.070 --> 00:00:13.854
paragraphs, buttons, and form fields.

00:00:13.904 --> 00:00:15.692
Sizes, spacing, colours,

00:00:15.742 --> 00:00:20.211
and the admin’s own font remain consistent with the design.
